
### 1. 查询所有文章
GET http://localhost:8085/articles

### 2. 创建新文章
POST http://localhost:8080/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Go后端项目实战",
  "content": "今天学习Gin的POST请求"
}

### 3. 根据 ID 查询文章
GET http://localhost:8080/articles/4

### 4. 测试错误请求
POST http://localhost:8080/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "content": ""
}
### 5. 删除 ID 为 1 的文章
DELETE http://localhost:8085/articles/1

### 6. 删除后再次查询
GET http://localhost:8080/articles/1

### 7. 测试不存在的文章
DELETE http://localhost:8080/articles/999

### 8. 测试非法 ID
PUT http://localhost:8085/articles/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "测试",
  "content": "测试内容"
}


### 1. 新增文章（需要完成 Author 字段改造）
POST http://localhost:8085/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Go语言项目实战",
  "content": "今天学习GORM条件查询",
  "author": "张三"
}

### 2. 根据标题搜索
GET http://localhost:8085/articles/search?title=Go

### 3. 根据作者查询
GET http://localhost:8085/articles/author/张三

### 4. 查询最新文章
GET http://localhost:8085/articles/latest

### 5. 查询指定文章
GET http://localhost:8080/articles/1



### 1. 创建文章
POST http://localhost:8080/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "第8课 GORM项目实战",
  "content": "学习更加规范的数据库CRUD操作"
}

### 2. 查询所有文章
GET http://localhost:8085/articles

### 3. 统计文章总数
GET http://localhost:8085/articles/count

### 4. 修改文章（把 ID 改为 POST 返回的实际 ID）
PUT http://localhost:8085/articles/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "第8课 GORM进阶",
  "content": "这是一篇修改后的文章",
  "author": "cs"
}

### 5. 重复修改为完全相同的内容
PUT http://localhost:8080/articles/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "第8课 GORM进阶",
  "content": "这是一篇修改后的文章"
}

### 6. 查询不存在的文章
GET http://localhost:8080/articles/999999

### 7. 修改不存在的文章
PUT http://localhost:8080/articles/999999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "不存在的文章",
  "content": "测试404错误"
}

### 8. 删除文章（改为实际 ID）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/articles/1

### 9. 再次删除同一篇文章
DELETE http://localhost:8080/articles/1
